{"version":1,"content":"<p>據知名爆料人士透露，蘋果目前正在為iPhone誕生20周年開發四款機型，採用兩種不同的設計方案。這名爆料人士在社交平台發佈的新消息中介紹了兩種設計。據稱，其中兩款採用平面玻璃蓋板，另外兩款則採用沿四條邊緣彎曲的玻璃設計。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586978.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.737466+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:21:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:57.435954+00:00","content_hash":"63a1851b312e4233286fa9524fba6fc03f17821cc0683524f870299f81ce15ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}